{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02505","headline":"早发成皐望河 · 刘孝孙","name":"早发成皐望河","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清晨发岩邑，车马走轘辕。\n回瞰黄河上，惝怳屡飞魂。\n鸿流遵积石，惊浪下龙门。\n仙槎不辨处，沈璧想犹存。\n远近洲渚出，飒沓凫鴈喧。\n怀古空延伫，叹逝将何言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘孝孙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02505.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02505","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}